{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1902","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Collapsing Strings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$n$$$ strings $$$s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_n$$$, consisting of lowercase Latin letters. Let $$$|x|$$$ be the length of string $$$x$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"collapse"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$C(a, b)$$$ of two strings $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ be the following operation: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$a$$$ is empty, $$$C(a, b) = b$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if $$$b$$$ is empty, $$$C(a, b) = a$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" if the last letter of $$$a$$$ is equal to the first letter of $$$b$$$, then $$$C(a, b) = C(a_{1,|a|-1}, b_{2,|b|})$$$, where $$$s_{l,r}$$$ is the substring of $$$s$$$ from the $$$l$$$-th letter to the $$$r$$$-th one; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise, $$$C(a, b) = a + b$$$, i. e. the concatenation of two strings. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Calculate $$$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^n \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^n |C(s_i, s_j)|$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains a string $$$s_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le |s_i| \\le 10^6$$$), consisting of lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The total length of the strings doesn't exceed $$$10^6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — $$$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^n \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^n |C(s_i, s_j)|$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\naba\nab\nba\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n20\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\nabab\nbabx\nxab\nxba\nbab\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n126\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1902E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/